# Applied by yq to the rendered chart (default.nix, and the Talos lab's
# renders): what values.yaml cannot set in the pinned chart.
#
# The operator's liveness probe is hard-coded to a 3 s timeout and the
# default 3 failures. On a loaded node, such as a control plane while every
# Cilium agent starts at once, both operator replicas were killed on liveness
# in the lab. Give it 10 s and 12 failures (two minutes of a failing probe)
# before restarting; readiness stays as the chart has it.
(select(.kind == "Deployment" and .metadata.name == "cilium-operator")
  | .spec.template.spec.containers[]
  | select(.name == "cilium-operator")
  | .livenessProbe) |= (.timeoutSeconds = 10 | .failureThreshold = 12)
